_AW_ENDSCRIPT_AW_


_AW_SCRIPT_AW_(send_btn)
_AW_ONCLICK_AW_
Call send_f()
_AW_ONENDSUB_AW_
_AW_ENDSCRIPT_AW_


_AW_SCRIPT_AW_(next_btn)
_AW_ONCLICK_AW_
Call send_c()
_AW_ONENDSUB_AW_
_AW_ENDSCRIPT_AW_


